<main class="lt-settings"><h1>Social Publishing · <%= @site.name %></h1><p>Publish approved social campaigns through your configured Lightek social gateway. Provider account authorization must be configured at the gateway.</p><%= form_with url: dashboard_social_connections_path(site_id: @site.id), method: :post do %><%= label_tag :account_label, "Connected account label" %><%= text_field_tag :account_label, nil, required: true %><%= submit_tag "Add publishing destination" %><% end %><h2>Publishing destinations</h2><% @connections.each do |connection| %><section><h3><%= connection.account_label %></h3><% @campaigns.each do |campaign| %><%= button_to "Publish: #{campaign.name}", publish_dashboard_social_connection_path(site_id: @site.id, connection_id: connection.id, campaign_id: campaign.id), method: :post %><% end %></section><% end %><%= link_to "Business Command Center", dashboard_business_hub_path(site_id: @site.id) %></main>